":[{"bytes":622,"path":"candidate.json","sha256":"c60cf8348323a45690181ff7af7b22b5f4bbb36312c2d8a1102ee51208d2a835"},{"bytes":2014,"path":"solution.py","sha256":"66ae1fcc3d202815ce2dd10f7dbb91577a1dc229e09c26342ef0f7e5522e8067"}],"kind":"timeout","purpose":"\u00a77's timeout row. The candidate ignores SIGTERM and forks a grandchild that beats a heartbeat file forever. If the harness SIGKILLed only the direct child, the grandchild would survive and the heartbeat would keep growing after tau; because \u00a77 kills the process GROUP, the heartbeat stops dead at tau. That is the difference between a budget and a suggestion.","role":"timeout","source_sha256":"9720d9c1c6bff2d1a34f777efa06ecf48284687fb1bd0fef62776bb7d7df48fa","version":"1.0.0"},{"candidate_id":"c21_ok_parity_probe","dir":"c21_ok_parity_probe","expected":{"failure_kind":null,"rows":["exact-aggregation"],"status":"ok"},"files":[{"bytes":613,"path":"candidate.json","sha256":"7d0dbd660951e926364354f159aa1cb861e0733c019b3902a27636057ba1154a"},{"bytes":1239,"path":"solution.py","sha256":"a97af2b9a749d1e65e2ab102a76caba8864955befaaa85d6a71d188e9cc00588"}],"kind":"ok","purpose":"A trivial deterministic candidate whose achieved cut is a construction parameter of the graphs under graphs_tmp/float_tie_{A,B}/: the graphs are built with the exact number of cross-parity edges needed to make both sets' exact score equal to 10/21 while their naive float means differ. It is the end-to-end half of the exact-aggregation proof (#6) -- real graphs, real candidate, real aggregate.","role":"arithmetic-probe","source_sha256":"d6a87ed0e5560cfbebe900221236ea2a4c7dfc5a7fa87ba015afa9f6c54f054d","version":"1.0.0"},{"candidate_id":"c20_env_probe","dir":"c20_env_probe","expected":{"failure_kind":null,"rows":["env-probe"],"status":"ok"},"files":[{"bytes":477,"path":"candidate.json","sha256":"2193beb5524b59c3ae088a6a3c1d6a432dfe85ba9e7ab515501b67f8764bf5ed"},{"bytes":1577,"path":"solution.py","sha256":"9188dde5ed7f757458cdd30b5d5b69aff540